    <section class="chapter" id="ch10">
        <h2 class="chapter-title">Chapter 10 — Failure Modes and Trade-offs</h2>

        <div class="concept">
            <h3>Component Failure Map</h3>
            <table class="info-table">
                <tr><th>Component</th><th>Failure</th><th>What Happens</th><th>Fix</th></tr>
                <tr><td>Vectorize</td><td>Down</td><td>kbSearch returns null → falls back to web search</td><td>Retry + circuit breaker</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Workers AI</td><td>Timeout</td><td>Error SSE event sent</td><td>Client retry with same threadId</td></tr>
                <tr><td>KV (rate limit)</td><td>Eventually consistent</td><td>21 requests instead of 20</td><td>Acceptable; or use DO counter</td></tr>
                <tr><td>DO SQLite</td><td>DO evicted</td><td>Data persists — reloads on next request</td><td>Designed behavior</td></tr>
                <tr><td>D1 (audit)</td><td>Write fails</td><td>Wrapped in .catch() — zero user impact</td><td>Fire-and-forget by design</td></tr>
                <tr><td>LTM extraction</td><td>Invalid JSON</td><td>Silently ignored — future turns work</td><td>Best-effort by design</td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="concept">
            <h3>Trade-offs — When You'd Choose Differently</h3>
            <table class="info-table">
                <tr><th>Decision</th><th>Trade-off</th><th>When to Change</th></tr>
                <tr><td>Eager tool dispatch</td><td>~500ms extra latency</td><td>If Workers AI supported function calling in streaming</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Same model as judge</td><td>Self-grading bias</td><td>Use Claude as judge via Anthropic API</td></tr>
                <tr><td>KV rate limiting</td><td>Eventual consistency</td><td>Billing-critical APIs → DO counter</td></tr>
                <tr><td>One Vectorize index</td><td>Filter bug risk</td><td>Regulated data (PII) → separate indexes</td></tr>
                <tr><td>HS256 JWT</td><td>Shared secret</td><td>Multi-service → RS256 (asymmetric)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>20-turn limit</td><td>Older context lost</td><td>Summarize old turns instead of deleting</td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="questions">
            <h3>Interview Questions</h3>
            <details><summary>Q: What happens if Vectorize goes down?</summary>
            <div><p><code>kbSearch()</code> returns null. Agent falls back to web search, then training data. No single tool failure blocks the response — graceful degradation by design.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Q: What's the biggest weakness?</summary>
            <div><p>Self-grading bias in evals. Agent and judge both use Llama 3.3 70B. Scores are likely inflated. Fix: Claude as judge via Anthropic API.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Q: What would you change if you rebuilt from scratch?</summary>
            <div><p>Four things: (1) Different model as eval judge. (2) Add reranking after Vectorize retrieval. (3) Summarize old turns instead of deleting. (4) More aggressive LTM extraction for deal context.</p></div></details>
        </div>
    </section>

